<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Shiny Pradeep Gunti | Portfolio</title>

<style>
body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    background: #f5f7fa;
    color: #333;
}

header {
    background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.6), rgba(0,0,0,0.6)),
                url('vehicle.jpg') center/cover;
    height: 100vh;
    color: white;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 50px;
}

header h1 {
    font-size: 48px;
    margin: 0;
}

header p {
    font-size: 20px;
    margin-top: 10px;
}

section {
    padding: 60px 10%;
}

h2 {
    color: #0b3d91;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.card {
    background: white;
    padding: 20px;
    margin: 20px 0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    transition: transform 0.3s;
}

.card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
}

img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 10px;
    margin-top: 20px;
}

.stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.stat {
    flex: 1;
    background: #0b3d91;
    color: white;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    text-align: center;
}

footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px;
    background: #0b3d91;
    color: white;
}

/* Animation */
.fade-in {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    animation: fadeIn 1s forwards;
}

@keyframes fadeIn {
    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div>
        <h1>Shiny Pradeep Gunti</h1>
        <p>Advisor – Women & Child Development & Police Department</p>
        <p><strong>From Bidar to Karnataka – A Model for Women Safety</strong></p>
    </div>
</header>

<section class="fade-in">
    <h2>About</h2>
    <div class="card">
        <p>
        Shiny Pradeep Gunti is a dedicated advisor working with Women & Child Development and Police Department.
        She played a key role in initiating the Akka Pade program at district level in Bidar,
        which later expanded across Karnataka due to its success and impact.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="fade-in">
    <h2>Statewide Impact</h2>
    <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat">📍 Started in Bidar</div>
        <div class="stat">🌍 Expanded to Karnataka</div>
        <div class="stat">👩‍🦰 Women Safety Focus</div>
        <div class="stat">🤝 WCD + Police</div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="fade-in">
    <h2>Government Support</h2>
    <div class="card">
        <p>
        The Government strengthened the Akka Pade initiative by providing dedicated Bolero vehicles
        for each district along with a trained 4-member team. This ensures rapid response and effective
        field-level support for women and children across Karnataka.
        </p>
        <img src="vehicle.jpg" alt="Akka Pade Vehicle">
    </div>
</section>

<section class="fade-in">
    <h2>From One District to Entire State</h2>
    <div class="card">
        <p>
        The Akka Pade initiative started in Bidar as a focused effort to support women and children.
        Due to its success, it received recognition from government leadership and expanded across Karnataka.
        Today, it serves as a strong model for community policing and women empowerment.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 Shiny Pradeep Gunti | Public Service Portfolio</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
